      biggestProductDecisions: `Investing in a large-scale campus \u2014 the Infosys "cities" \u2014 gave clients a factory metaphor they trusted. Adopting SEI-CMM Level 5 processes before competitors made "Indian IT" a globally credible category. Nasdaq listing in 1999 turned an Indian company into a peer of American ones.`,
