    openingScene: `2014. Harshil and Shashank were building an online store for helmets. Every time a customer tried to pay, the checkout crashed. The payment gateway was a fossil. Documentation didn\u2019t exist. Refunds took weeks. They spent more time debugging payments than selling helmets. Then, one afternoon, they closed the helmet store, sat down, and built the payment gateway they wished existed.`,
